  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "上愛ê滋味"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<h1><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作者：</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">韓滿</span></h1><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsîng細漢阮就tsiok愛食mé-lóng-pháng，m̄-koh，阿姊講伊無愛食pháng，伊顛倒khah愛食麻糍。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">以早，若到下晡，tshiâng-tsāi看一个婦jîn人牽一台老鐵馬，後座囥一跤箱仔，大街小巷leh賣pháng，小妹若看--著就吵beh買。蔥仔pháng、紅豆pháng、牛奶pháng一塊lóng五箍，mé-lóng-pháng無包餡khah俗，兩塊tsiah賣五箍niâ，我khai五箍買兩塊，kap小妹一人食一塊就食kah飽tu-tu。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">khah大漢ê時，逐工暗頭仔有一个緣投ê少年家，駛一台改裝ê銅管仔車，載麻糍kap pháng沿路teh huah賣，鹹麻糍包菜脯米，甜麻糍包塗豆、紅豆、烏麻仔。賣麻糍ê少年家若來賣，阿姊見擺去買lóng kap伊講話講bē煞。有一回阿姊問伊tuì佗位來--ê？是按怎囥麻糍ê柴箱仔ē寫「一枝草一點露ê精神／一台車thuh規嘉義ê堅持／一領siat-tsuh、一領拍鐵仔褲ê勇氣／一个小人物ê精神」？原來少年--ê原本tī台北食頭路，in阿母逐工出門賣mi̍h件。有一日阿母發生車禍跤斷--去，伊就án-ne tńg來故鄉照顧阿母順suà出來賣麻糍kap pháng。伊ê故事hōo阮逐家聽kah tsiok感動--neh！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">有一擺阿媽來阮兜看孫仔，beh暗仔hit个少年家koh出來賣。阿姊khah-mé買一盒阿媽上愛食ê菜脯米麻糍，koh買一盒阮逐家lóng tsiok食ê紅豆麻糍，少年頭家賣kah tsiok歡喜，阮逐家mā食kah喙笑目笑。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">逐家lóng食了--ah，賰阿媽家己khuann-khuann仔食，阿媽ná看電視ná食伊ê麻糍，歡喜kah一直講菜脯米是伊做查某囡仔時上愛ê滋味，菜脯米ê口感tsiok phong-phài--ê，lio̍h-lio̍h仔鹹鹹koh hiam-hiam ê口味，hōo人tsiok想beh一喙suà一喙。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">因為麻糍黏黏，阿媽食第二粒ê時，無細膩suah kā假喙齒黏--起-來，伊就kā假喙齒剝落來囥tī一張衛生紙面頂，想講食煞喙洗好tsiah-koh kā假喙齒鬥--tńg-去。Tsit-tsūn pùn-sò車拄好來--ah，負責倒pùn-sò ê大姊，看著桌頂ê衛生紙，無講無tànn就té入去pùn-sò袋仔，走去tàn pùn-sò。等阿媽kā喙洗好、想beh鬥喙齒ê時，已經siunn慢--looh！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿姊tsiok歹勢一直kā阿媽會失禮，阿母隨tshuā阿媽koh去做一副假喙齒。以後，阿媽見若講著伊食麻糍，假喙齒suah拍m̄見ê代誌就講kah笑hai-hai！</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span></span><span><!--more--></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiHKOmFKiS1PW0hpQfH76IVS2UWVyORWWh9NEEss1_j930g_ZpkPwbA5Jbg8YKnd5jVOrm8tx95fWmv0zmSBdIQikUupnbtUXG032y4L8SbdMNNun6wkIG1qW10CScrj2nLX6TuM7RPPvaMNw0nh0NtqS3U6Un7Ye4BSLEaZm0io7iSynmIBcVEKE6qYD8S/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1355%E6%9C%9F_29.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiHKOmFKiS1PW0hpQfH76IVS2UWVyORWWh9NEEss1_j930g_ZpkPwbA5Jbg8YKnd5jVOrm8tx95fWmv0zmSBdIQikUupnbtUXG032y4L8SbdMNNun6wkIG1qW10CScrj2nLX6TuM7RPPvaMNw0nh0NtqS3U6Un7Ye4BSLEaZm0io7iSynmIBcVEKE6qYD8S/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1355%E6%9C%9F_29.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjM-bIuV3DvmWH8EQDWqyYYQBuUgVbCdztkL7FH4yTHadRrL9jXEW_yFGcKhIAv5PCzjCxEaUkhSMmVRch4DyahFUqOxbu9nckt7nFqnWk0I3omzOMzF7nPNHzysYPUyYHEmXJTSXZy7ymwQEDr2z2sY6uGC46Fp54CIRXVB-RlqHbIIQ-OpRw2qvGAJjLB/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1355%E6%9C%9F_028.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" da